sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 浏览器
    participant MW as 前置中间件
    participant Static as 静态文件
    participant Wrapper as ResponseWrapper
    participant Router as Router
    participant Controller as Controller
    participant Service as Service
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant DB as SQLite

    Client->>MW: GET /api/books
    MW->>MW: 错误处理/CORS/日志/解析
    MW->>Static: 非静态文件，继续
    Static->>Wrapper: 继续
    Wrapper->>Router: 路由匹配
    Router->>Controller: listBooks(ctx)
    Controller->>Service: getBookList()
    Service->>Repo: findAll()
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM ebooks
    DB-->>Repo: 数据
    Repo-->>Service: [Ebook模型]
    Service->>Service: 转换为DTO
    Service-->>Controller: [BookDTO]
    Controller-->>Wrapper: ctx.body = data
    Wrapper->>Wrapper: 包装为 {code,data,msg}
    Wrapper-->>Client: 200 JSON
